Subject: [PATCH 173/175] XD Netplay: transcript marks moves that never
 happened; Last Battle button; saved teams above the team box; keep the sent
 team as Last sent

A chosen move is confirmed by its PP in that GBA's next turn block: a Pokemon
knocked out, flinched or asleep before moving spends none. The last turn's
result is marked unknown, since XD sends nothing after it.
